# ============================================
# 星之匣 npm 镜像配置
# ============================================
#
# 注意：Electron 31+ / npm 10+ 对自定义 key 会报 Unknown project config 警告。
# 以下配置不会报错，但 electron 的 install.js 不一定能读到。
#
# 推荐做法：用环境变量（Electron install.js 真正认的方式）
#   CMD:    set ELECTRON_MIRROR=https://cdn.npmmirror.com/binaries/electron/
#   PowerShell: $env:ELECTRON_MIRROR='https://cdn.npmmirror.com/binaries/electron/'
#   Git Bash: export ELECTRON_MIRROR=https://cdn.npmmirror.com/binaries/electron/
#
# electron-builder 二进制镜像同理（用于打包时下载 NSIS / winCodeSign 等）
#   CMD:    set ELECTRON_BUILDER_BINARIES_MIRROR=https://cdn.npmmirror.com/binaries/electron-builder-binaries/
# ============================================
